$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Find and Retrieve\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Delta Saggitarius II\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Misty\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Mid-afternoon\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::TeamName0> and <vServer::TeamName1> are battling for control over the planet of Gamma Thiatis II. The two teams have constructed bases on both sides of an abandoned dam, in which 5 flags and two objectives are hidden.  Whoever holds the most flags and objectives is the victor!";
